WEBVTT

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:10.060
There's a "Master of the
Library" at Fujigaya...

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.580
"Master of the Library"?

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:21.220
Some teacher was messing around and called a
girl who loves books that, and the name stuck.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.570
That's great.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.600
Why do you have tears in your eyes?

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.120
Please don't move in so close to
me while I'm still not ready.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.380
All right, to get ready...

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.550
Huh?

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.980
Take a deep breath.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:56.850
Were you nervous?

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.000
I was...

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.170
My heart was pounding too.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.200
You get that way too, Sempai?

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.670
Of course. What do you think I am?

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:12.870
No, I mean I thought that I was the one
whose heart was always pounding...

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:15.470
Yeah?

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:20.280
Always?

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:25.190
I mean, I thought it was just me
who was feeling these emotions.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:28.820
I thought they might be unrequited...

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:31.140
You're adorable, Fumi.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.650
Let's meet up and walk to school each day,

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:36.990
OK?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.690
Do I look strange?

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.810
I hope I don't look like a kid.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.930
You're adorable, Fumi.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.400
Thanks for breakfast.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:31.980
I'm off to school.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:35.290
Be sure to turn the cellphone off at school.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:39.100
How do I turn it off?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:40.740
Hold the red button.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:47.340
And fill me in a bit on what your boyfriend
says when he texts you.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.110
I don't have a boyfriend!

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:51.690
But it's only a matter of time
before you do, right?

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:00.500
Fumi-chan!              Fumi!

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:06.940
Achan...

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:13.020
Oh, so you used to go to Fujigaya.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.570
Yep. I was in the Drama Club.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:17.950
That's why they roped me
into helping out again.

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:19.540
Oh, that makes sense.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:22.280
Let's go together tomorrow, too!

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:25.540
Fumi-chan...

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:26.190
Huh?

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:29.850
What's up with you? You're so quiet today.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.090
Bye.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.080
See you.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.800
See you later, Fumi-chan.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.580
She's so full of energy.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:49.350
Sempai...

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.450
Hmm?

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:54.530
We have to stop commuting
to school together.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:57.810
Huh? Oh, because of Achan.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:02.150
You promised you'd commute in with her
and then bumped into me on the way...

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:05.240
Sounds like something out
of elementary school.

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:09.320
Will she be upset if we're together?

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.330
Achan isn't like that.

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:18.030
We can't have you losing favor with
your friends now, can we?

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:19.500
I'm sorry.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.240
I'll let Achan commute with you.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:21.920
Huh?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.470
But save the trip home for me.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.520
We can start doing this tomorrow.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:27.850
Sempai...

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.580
Girls sure are a lot to handle.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:36.100
Good morning, big sisters.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.750
G-Good morning.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:38.880
'Morning.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:40.980
Okudaira-san.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:41.520
Huh?

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.300
About Ko-chan...

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.560
Ko-chan?

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:48.100
The guy I introduced to you the
other day, Ko Sawanai-san.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:48.870
Oh, him.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:52.700
Well, it seems he likes you.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.140
He wants to see you again.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.380
Oh, great...

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.620
What? You didn't like him?

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:03.580
It's not that. It's just... I'm not
ready for that sort of thing.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:08.540
Honestly, I don't know a thing
about dating a grown-up.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.170
Grown-up?

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.790
He's about as far from grown-up as it gets.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:19.010
Meet up with him if you change your mind.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.050
Look both ways.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:38.220
Excuse me, do you have any indigo embroidery
thread that's lighter than these?

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:43.870
Drama Club

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.870
Oh, it's Kagami-sensei.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.220
What brings him around these parts?

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:50.910
Kawasaki, is Miura here?

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.620
Kaori said she'd be late because
of a student council meeting.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:55.940
I see.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.370
So, how are rehearsals going?

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.730
We haven't started rehearsing yet.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:02.550
Huh?

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.820
We begin the script-reads tomorrow.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.980
Oh, I see.

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:11.740
Sensei, please start coming here regularly.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.410
You're supposed to be the faculty
member in charge of us,

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.500
yet you're worse than a
bogus club member.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.860
Right. I'll start doing that.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:20.520
That sounded completely fake.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.570
So yeah, I heard you asked
Sugimoto to join?

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:28.220
We did, but she didn't seem too enthused.

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:30.500
Kaori twisted her arm a bit.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:31.800
I see.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.500
Kagami-sensei!

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:42.930
I'm Kyoko Ikumi. I'm a first year
student in the Drama Club.

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:45.560
Oh, glad to have you on board.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:50.250
I have something I'd like to ask you.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:51.080
Hmm?

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:56.570
You know Sugimoto-sempai
pretty well, don't you?

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.320
Why would you think that?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.860
I can just sorta tell...

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:08.610
I don't know myself.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:12.500
I wish I could help.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.310
Ah, Ikumi-san!

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:35.270
I bought this, but I'm not
sure it's the right one...

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.990
OK, that's enough for one day.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:44.950
Good work, guys.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.920
Wanna stop for tea on the way home?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.900
I wonder if she's waiting for someone.

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.580
That's pretty bold.

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:59.600
What are you doing here, Fumi-chan?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.330
I was waiting for you.

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:02.240
What?!

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.380
Okudaira-san.

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:05.970
I'm heading home.

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:06.900
But...

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:10.000
It's fine. See you tomorrow.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.960
Is this because of what happened
with Sugimoto-sempai?

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:18.100
Ah, it is.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:29.630
If you know the reason Sugimoto-sempai left
Fujigaya, could you tell me what it is?

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:35.190
She won't tell me anything about it.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.590
I don't know myself.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.500
I wish I could help.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:52.420
Fumi-chan...

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.960
What happened this morning
still bothers you, huh?

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.650
Forget about it!

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:00.580
It's not like it was a firm promise.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:04.890
I'm going to commute with you.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:08.210
I'm not going in with Sugimoto-sempai anymore.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:12.540
Fumi-chan, it's not like
I'm pouting over this.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.790
You can commute with
whomever you want.

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:16.260
I'm going with you, Achan.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:19.340
How about the three of
us commute together?

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.550
No!

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.790
I'm going with you.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:28.250
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.720
You ordered two lemon teas, right?

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:32.220
Yes, thank you.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.950
I enjoy commuting with you.

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:43.920
I just forgot about it this morning.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.670
You look good in pigtails, Fumi-chan.

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.630
It's cute.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:53.080
I'm in love with Sugimoto-sempai.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:57.880
We're dating.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.420
Please don't hate me.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.900
Don't think it's gross!

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:24.490
I guess she must feel uncomfortable
after confessing such a thing.

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:26.740
I'm in love with Sugimoto-sempai.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.770
We're dating.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:33.500
I don't see anything wrong
with a girl liking girls.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:38.450
Maybe I'm just too simpleminded.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.690
Still...

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:45.800
Don't think it's gross!

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:51.850
I didn't think it was gross.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.830
Confucius said, "Fine words and
an insinuating appearance..."

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:59.190
"...are seldom associated with true virtue."

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.620
"Fine words" refers to being
a smooth talker...

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:07.180
Sorry. I overslept.

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:11.880
You got rid of your pigtails!

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:12.590
Huh?

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:14.110
They looked so good on you,

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:15.590
Manjome-san.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:19.270
OK, next will be Hon'atsugi-san.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.010
Yes, sir!

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.750
First Year, Fuji Class

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.350
Hey, Ikumi-san...

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:28.910
Hmm?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:33.240
What would you do if the person
I liked turned out to be a girl?

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:36.440
Oh, is that why you don't like Ko-chan?

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:39.480
No, no. I'm speaking in hypotheticals.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.970
Hypotheticals, huh?

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:49.810
Then, hypothetically speaking, what would
you do if the person I liked was a girl?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.250
Support... you?

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:58.580
So isn't that the best answer?

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:04.040
Matsuoka Girls Secondary School

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:04.020
Fight! Fight!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:06.330
Literary Club

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.330
To Fujigaya?

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:07.570
Yeah.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:11.980
Let's take Pon-chan and them and
those spunky young ladies too.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:17.310
What's wrong? You don't want to go?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:23.690
I told Achan everything about us, Sempai.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:27.500
And now, I don't know how to face her.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.860
That's amazing, Fumi.

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:30.670
Huh?

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:35.170
It's amazing that you came
out of the closet.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.180
Yeah, I guess I did.

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:41.080
You're something special,
Fumi. You're strong.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:45.210
You're embarking on a path of thorns.

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:49.050
I just want Achan to know.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:52.500
So you hold a special place for Achan.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.460
Then it's settled.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:57.920
We're going to Fujigaya.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:58.450
Huh?

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:00.490
Come on, let's go.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.980
I told you that's a lie!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.020
Yo.

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:07.730
You love bringing those little girls with you.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:12.200
They're my girls. I take them
all over the place.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.200
What are they, your princely retainers?

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.080
Is Kagami-sensei here?

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.230
I bet he's in the faculty room.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.250
I'm gonna go say hi then.

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:25.510
Achan!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:28.990
Can we go to Fujigaya's tea room?

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:30.380
Wh-Why not.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:31.490
Yay!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.110
You're coming too, right, Achan?

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:34.510
S-Sure.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:35.950
All right, let's do it!

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:38.120
You come too, Manjome-san.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.720
Hey, come on...

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.390
I'm going. Stop pushing me.

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.200
Hey.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.340
Here for rehearsal?

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.340
Yes.

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:54.350
We're going to be doing script-reads
starting today,

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:56.750
so I figured I'd come and say hi.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.250
Look at this!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.950
They've even got a cake set here!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:05.990
Cake? They can eat it at school?

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:09.270
Their tea selection is awesome too.
Queen Mary, Darjeeling and Orange Pekoe!

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:10.490
Wow!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:11.580
Fumi-chan,

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.050
That's amazing.

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:15.160
you stood me up yesterday.

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:17.530
U-Umm, well...

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.650
What should I do?

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.340
Huh?

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:25.700
I want to support you,

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:29.030
but I don't know how to do that exactly.

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:32.980
Well...

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.670
Just act normal!

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.910
Oh, act normal... Right...

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:46.100
Y-Yeah, act normal!
I didn't even think of that.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:16:00.060
Achan, Manjome-san!
Did you decide what to order?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.050
I'm getting a strawberry Napoleon.

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:04.250
I'm getting gâteau chocolat.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.640
I'll be leaving now.

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:10.610
OK.

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:13.060
Sensei?

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:13.730
Hmm?

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:16.420
Please definitely come see the play.

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:19.550
I'm playing Heathcliff, after all.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:22.440
Of course. I'm your adviser.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.620
<i>Because he's my adviser,</i> he says.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:40.950
Did my face twitch when he said that?

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.550
Put your left hand just a little bit forward.

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:47.240
And put your head a bit to the left.

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:48.390
OK, that's good.

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:05.330
Yasuko-chan, you're really good at drawing.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:06.380
Isn't she?

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:10.580
Maybe she'll get into art school when
she graduates high school.

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:15.800
Art is great, but I'd be even happier
if she joined the Drama Club.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:19.030
Hey, are you recruiting for your club now?

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:30.890
That's your special location,
isn't it, Sugimoto?

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:37.180
I always see you here from the breezeway.

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:40.350
Always...

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.510
Let's pretend you didn't say that.

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:03.730
I apologize.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.300
I refuse to shake hands!

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.060
And I bet you don't want
to sully yourself either.

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:20.790
You just need to wash your
face and comb your hair.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:24.490
I don't want anyone touching me! I don't!

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.480
Oh, sorry.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:31.280
Drama Club

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.270
OK, take five.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:38.620
Hey, is she from the Art Club?

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:39.210
Huh?

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:43.640
Yeah, she's in charge of the
posters for Wuthering Heights.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.540
She said she likes to draw real images.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.830
This really is a lovely place.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:01.490
So why did Sempai leave it?

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:06.650
There's a "Master of the
Library" at Fujigaya...

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:07.730
What?

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:17.020
Some teacher was messing around and called a
girl who loves books that, and the name stuck.

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.760
"Master of the Library"?

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:26.660
Yeah.

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:29.670
Never heard it.

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:30.990
I see.

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:32.550
Have you, Ikumi-san?

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:33.650
Nope.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:35.480
I wouldn't be surprised
at our school, though.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.370
Huh?

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:37.870
Do you know of it, Iwakuma?

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.190
Nope.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.700
Like a forbidden relationship between the
Master of the Library and a teacher...

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:46.380
Oh, forbidden love makes it sound so dirty!

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:48.290
Stop with those fantasies.

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:56.220
OK, that's all for today.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:57.370
Good work.

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:58.660
Good work today.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:13.420
Sempai?

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.570
Hmm?

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.440
Umm, about the library...

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.500
Something happen at the library?

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:27.610
There's a book I'd like to read. I was wondering
if you could take it out for me.

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:30.460
Why not have Achan get it for you?

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:33.730
You're not supposed to re-loan it, but it'll
be OK as long as they don't find out.

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:36.620
Oh, that's true. Good idea.

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:44.250
I want to ask her, so why can't I do it?

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:52.880
Sempai, who's the Master of the Library?

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.320
Who is the teacher who gave
them that nickname,

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:01.510
and who is the student who
got that nickname?

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:11.930
I guess it's the Master of
the Library for now...

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.910
Youth is a Lovely Thing

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.860
See you next time.
